# Design System & Tenant Theming

Source of truth: `docs/architecture/design-system.md`.

## Ownership

`packages/frontend-ui`: shadcn/ui over Radix, semantic CSS-variable tokens, shared Tailwind preset, `ThemeProvider`.

- Presentation only — no RTK Query, no business logic
- Components use **semantic** tokens (`bg-primary`), never hard-coded brand hex

## Runtime Branding

Tenant branding (brand color, light/dark, optional radius/logo) is applied at runtime via CSS variables — no rebuild.

```typescript
<ThemeProvider branding={tenantBranding}>
  <App />
</ThemeProvider>
```

Branding shape comes from `contracts`; app fetches and passes it to `ThemeProvider`.

## Minimum

Brand color + light/dark must work. Extend tokens carefully; keep Radix accessibility intact.
